      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup before publishing\nStore the same 32+ character random token as Vercel Secret N8N_INTAKE_TOKEN and in the Luminol CRM Intake credential. Use templated custom auth with template {\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer {{api_key}}\"}} and store the secret in api_key. Redeploy the CRM. Run Test CRM connection with sample, then confirm the sample in Admissions. Publishing starts polling every five minutes. Only rows created from 15 October 2026 at 13:10 UTC are eligible. No historical backfill or outbound messaging. Notes, raw metadata, payment and health details stay in n8n. Only a confirmed CRM response is recorded as delivered. Keep this workflow unpublished until the credential and connection test pass.",
